The crossing ran and returned, but the gate reserved its authorization at `T-003-opus-r1-codex` while the courier wrote `T-003-opus-r0-codex.json`: `dispatch-guard` derives the stem from the task's live `retries`, already incremented to 1 for the rework, and the courier derives it from the round that owed the debt. No reservation was ever made behind the r0 stem, so no re-dispatch can promote it, and the waiver is the only hatch. The verdict itself is on disk and its judgment is recorded in the courier comparison.
